        "@value": "Source citation for the data (e.g., \u0027Field survey 2024-03-15\u0027, \u0027GIS export v2.1\u0027, \u0027NESC Table 232-1\u0027). Applies to any CIMBOLOGY-KG data regardless of source tool.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "Provenance Citation"
      }
